     * SHA-256 over the UTF-8 bytes of {@code normalizedLastName + '|' + postcode}, where the last name
     * is normalized case-insensitively with collapsed whitespace (see {@link #normalizeHouseholdKey})
     * and the postcode is used exactly as stored. Owners with the same last name and postcode
     * therefore share the same {@code householdId} automatically. Returns {@code null} when the owner
     * has no last name or postcode, so it does not belong to a shared household.
     */
